<title>USA: Hanover Foods 5-mos pretax profit rises.</title>
<headline>Hanover Foods 5-mos pretax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Pa. 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hanover Foods Corp said on Tuesday that pre-tax earnings were $4,187,000 for the first five months ending October 29, 1996.</p>
<p>Last year's pre-tax profit for the same period was $257,000.</p>
<p>Sales were $102,990,000 versus sales of $100,259,000 last year during this period.</p>
